<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Phase 2 Best in Slot Gear list for Arcane Mage DPS in Wrath of the Lich King Classic. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Naxxramas, Obsidian Sanctum, Eye of Eternity, and Ulduar. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, BoE World drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 2</h2>Phase 2 brings with it <b>massive power gains</b> due to the upgraded ilvl of items, these cause most <b>Phase 1 items to get power crept</b> and not as relevant as gear was from phase to phase in the past. We still <b>aim for 8% Hit</b>, unless you're playing Alliance, in which case you aim for 7% due to <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=6562/heroic-presence">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_21.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heroic Presence</span></a>. It's important to remember the <b>secondary stats change value</b> depending on how much of each you already have - meaning they're hard to quantify into rankings and you should instead look at items as a whole.<ol>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Hit </b>- Aim for 8% Hit Rating (7% if <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'>Alliance</span>), because with the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=12840/arcane-focus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_devotion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcane Focus</span></a>, <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=29440/precision">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_ice_magicdamage.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Precision</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=33193/misery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_misery.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Misery</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=33602/improved-faerie-fire">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_faeriefire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Improved Faerie Fire</span></a> you'll be Hit Capped at 17%</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Spell Power</b> - Having higher spell power will increase the damage of the spells themselves.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Haste Rating</b> - Will increase the total amount of casts per fight.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Critical Strike Rating</b> - Increases the chance to critically hit spells, which are improved further by <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=35581/spell-power">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_arcane_arcanetorrent.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spell Power</span></a>.</div></li></ol>
