<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="body-armor">Body Armor for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 2</h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="head">Head for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 2</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45497/crown-of-luminescence">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_99.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Crown of Luminescence</span></a> is flat out the best head piece in Phase 2. Until you get this you can aim for high stat items such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45532/cowl-of-dark-whispers">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_136.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cowl of Dark Whispers</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45289/lifespark-visage">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_87.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lifespark Visage</span></a>. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40562/hood-of-rationality">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_133.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Hood of Rationality</span></a> is still a solid item that outperforms newer items unless you need Hit from this specific slot to get Hit capped with.<br/>
<br/>In this case where you do need Hit here, you can use <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46129/conquerors-kirin-tor-hood">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_133.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Kirin Tor Hood</span></a> either for 2-piece set bonus or if you have to use it for Hit with 2-piece already active, you can then aim for 4-piece <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-85/conquerors-kirin-tor-garb">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Kirin Tor Garb</span></a>. These can be valuable options if you decide to use a staff where the stats are more offensive instead of the Hit weapons that are recommended in the main list.<br/>
<br/>At the very start of your gearing process into T8, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40416/valorous-frostfire-circlet">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_crown_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valorous Frostfire Circlet</span></a> can still be useful if used to obtain the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-33/valorous-frostfire-garb">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Valorous Frostfire Garb</span></a> 2-piece bonus. This is a great early route of gearing with 2 piece T7 plus 2 piece T8 and even in full BiS is only slightly worse than 4-piece <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-85/conquerors-kirin-tor-garb">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Kirin Tor Garb</span></a>.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Recommended BiS Helm Enchant</b>: <a class="q7 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50368/arcanum-of-burning-mysteries">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_masterofelements.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcanum of Burning Mysteries</span></a>, requires Revered reputation with <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/faction=1090/kirin-tor">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Kirin Tor</span></a>.</div></div>
