<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="chest">Chest for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 2</h3>Because of the consistent and valuable proc of <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-85/conquerors-kirin-tor-garb">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Kirin Tor Garb</span></a>, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46130/conquerors-kirin-tor-tunic">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_43.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Kirin Tor Tunic</span></a> is the best item for this slot, with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45368/valorous-kirin-tor-tunic">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_43.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valorous Kirin Tor Tunic</span></a> a bit behind while still providing the same proc. If you already have this 2-set bonus from other slots, then it's worth considering an off-piece like <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45272/robes-of-the-umbral-brute">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_64.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robes of the Umbral Brute</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45240/raiments-of-the-iron-council">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_65.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Raiments of the Iron Council</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>The previous phase's best in slot off-piece chest <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=44002/the-sanctums-flowing-vestments">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_63.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Sanctum's Flowing Vestments</span></a> is better than other options not mentioned here, so outside of these don't bother chasing worst items. Alternatively, as mentioned with the head piece, <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-33/valorous-frostfire-garb">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Valorous Frostfire Garb</span></a> can be pretty good if using two-piece (assuming you're not giving up something like <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-85/conquerors-kirin-tor-garb">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Kirin Tor Garb</span></a>), because of this <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40418/valorous-frostfire-robe">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_cloth_43.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valorous Frostfire Robe</span></a> can be a pretty good early phase 2 option.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
