<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="wrist">Wrist for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 2</h3>Not many options here, the best bracers are <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45446/grasps-of-reason">
