<span class="tinyicontxt">The Obsidian Sanctum</span></a> which you can get down in a few minutes. If you do need Hit, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45275/bracers-of-unleashed-magic">
