<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="hands">Hands for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 2</h3>In the glove slot, phase 1 items simply get too out scaled, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45665/pharos-gloves">
