<br/>There's also a couple hit options, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46045/pulsar-gloves">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_70.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pulsar Gloves</span></a> which might be easier to obtain early on and can fill some Hit gaps you might have until you obtain better items. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46132/conquerors-kirin-tor-gauntlets">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Kirin Tor Gauntlets</span></a> fulfills the same goal but with added bonus that it can help provide 2 or 4 set bonus from the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-85/conquerors-kirin-tor-garb">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Kirin Tor Garb</span></a>, while also being very easy to obtain from the new <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4603/vault-of-archavon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Vault of Archavon</span></a> boss. Lastly, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45840/touch-of-the-occult">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_gauntlets_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Touch of the Occult</span></a> can be used around 4 pieces of tier as an early off piece that's easy to obtain similar to the conquest legs.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
