<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="waist">Waist for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 2</h3>Best belt is <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45619/starwatchers-binding">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_46.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Starwatcher's Binding</span></a>, it performs better than all other alternatives by a solid margin. There's also <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45119/embrace-of-the-leviathan">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_49.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Embrace of the Leviathan</span></a> which is still a very big upgrade from other items both new and old.<br/>
<br/>There's also <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40561/leash-of-heedless-magic">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leash of Heedless Magic</span></a> from Phase 1 and is now easier to get from 10-Man, this only gets outperformed by the two previously mentioned items which are huge, as well as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45558/cord-of-the-white-dawn">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_40b.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cord of the White Dawn</span></a> which is a new crafted item from <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=51309/tailoring">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_tailoring.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tailoring</span></a>. Alongside this, we also get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45557/sash-of-ancient-power">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_10.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sash of Ancient Power</span></a> which is also crafted, but instead grants Hit which is a great early item to fill a gap to use more offensive items on other slots until you're closer to a final gear set, this performs really well if the set calls for that hit amount.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
