<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="legs">Legs for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 2</h3>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45488/leggings-of-the-enslaved-idol">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_27.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of the Enslaved Idol</span></a> are best in slot, you use color accurate gems as well to activate the head piece meta gem since it provides a bonus better than most other items. This provides a lot of the required Hit for arcane while maintaining strong stats regardless. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46133/conquerors-kirin-tor-leggings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Kirin Tor Leggings</span></a> is a close alternative which performs a bit worse but significantly easier to get since it's available through <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4603/vault-of-archavon">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Vault of Archavon</span></a> and tier is always plenty. This item is strong regardless if it's providing a set bonus or not, but is stronger if it does help support <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-85/conquerors-kirin-tor-garb">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Conqueror's Kirin Tor Garb</span></a> bonuses. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45367/valorous-kirin-tor-leggings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valorous Kirin Tor Leggings</span></a> is similar but just a flat downgrade.<br/>
<br/>If you don't actually need Hit from this slot, then <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46034/leggings-of-profound-darkness">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of Profound Darkness</span></a> will be the best option here. At the same time, if you want an easier temporary option - there's <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45848/legwraps-of-the-master-conjurer">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_24.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Legwraps of the Master Conjurer</span></a> which you can buy with conquest eventually and performs about 80dps worse than <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=46034/leggings-of-profound-darkness">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of Profound Darkness</span></a> . Also, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40417/valorous-frostfire-leggings">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_05.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valorous Frostfire Leggings</span></a> which you likely already have or can easily get, they're as strong as most of the new options from <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4273/ulduar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ulduar</span></a> when combined with another piece of the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-33/valorous-frostfire-garb">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Valorous Frostfire Garb</span></a> like <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40416/valorous-frostfire-circlet">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_crown_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valorous Frostfire Circlet</span></a> while using a Hit Necklace, and a few hit gems.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
