<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 2</h2>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="neck">Neck for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 2</h3>A lot closer options when it comes to necks, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45243/sapphire-amulet-of-renewal">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_30naxxramas.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sapphire Amulet of Renewal</span></a> is the best. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45933/pendant-of-the-shallow-grave">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_46.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendant of the Shallow Grave</span></a> might be easier to get due to lower competition in 10-man and performs within 10-20 dps of each other. With <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45447/watchful-eye-of-fate">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_45.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Watchful Eye of Fate</span></a> another 10 dps behind that, there's plenty of options.  There's also <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45133/pendant-of-fiery-havoc">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendant of Fiery Havoc</span></a> which is one of the best options to fill Hit gaps outside of the main set listed at the top if you need extra. Lastly, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45822/evokers-charm">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Evoker's Charm</span></a> is very easy to obtain and is slightly better than previous phase's BiS assuming you don't need any Hit, which as arcane you shouldn't.<div class="pad"></div>
