<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="weapons">Weapons for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 2</h2>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-and-two-handed-weapons-for-arcane-mage-dps-phase-2">Main-Hand and Two-Handed Weapons for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 2</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45620/starshard-edge">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_92.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Starshard Edge</span></a> is the best weapon in phase 2. Note that <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45457/staff-of-endless-winter">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_94.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Staff of Endless Winter</span></a> is actually as good as the one-handed weapon combined with best in slot offhand for <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'>
<span class="gem8">Alliance</span></span> if combined with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45133/pendant-of-fiery-havoc">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_31.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Pendant of Fiery Havoc</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45242/drape-of-mortal-downfall">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_cape_13.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Drape of Mortal Downfall</span></a>, and some <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40049/veiled-monarch-topaz">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_30.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Veiled Monarch Topaz</span></a> if needed.<br/>
<br/>The same applies to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45886/icecore-staff">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_94.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Icecore Staff</span></a> which is slightly worse than the 25-man version. If you happen to play arena, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45970/furious-gladiators-mageblade">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_91.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Furious Gladiator's Mageblade</span></a> is a great option as well which outputs better dps than the rest of the PVE options available. Then there's <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45990/fusion-blade">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_132.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fusion Blade</span></a> which has a similar use to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45620/starshard-edge">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_shortblade_92.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Starshard Edge</span></a> but is worse than the previously mentioned items.<div class="quote-box" data-has-source="false" data-type="user">
<div class="quote-header"></div>
<div class="quote-body" data-markup-content-target="1">
