<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hand-weapons-for-arcane-mage-dps-phase-2">Off Hand Weapons for Arcane Mage DPS Phase 2</h4>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45617/cosmos">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_ulduarraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cosmos</span></a> will be the best option here. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45271/ironmender">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_ulduarraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ironmender</span></a> is quite worse even if using a good hit alternative on another slot such as cloak but is still the second best option. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45115/leviathan-fueling-manual">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_ulduarraid_d_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leviathan Fueling Manual</span></a> can be used early and then directly upgrade to <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45617/cosmos">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_ulduarraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cosmos</span></a> without other item swaps which is great. The other four options perform similarly to just use whichever fits your current set better based on what you already have.<div class="pad"></div>
<table class="grid max-width">
